Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:56.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《电锯惊魂》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！快来人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.51,0:01:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 我搞不好死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. I probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.55,0:01:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没死 - 是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not dead. - Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.15,0:01:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,把灯打开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn on the lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:01:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？这是哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is going on? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么味道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.93,0:02:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see a thing, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:02:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.34,0:03:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.45,0:03:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有人听见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么状况？- 你冷静一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the fuck is this? - Calm down. Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.89,0:03:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有受伤吗？- 我不知道 有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you hurt? - I don't know. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.50,0:03:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫莫名其妙 你呢？这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is very fucking confused. What's your name? What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.57,0:03:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫劳伦斯·戈登 我是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Lawrence Gordon. I'm a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是在这里醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just woke up here. Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认得他吗？- 不认得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Recognize that man? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是怎么来的？- 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have any idea how you got here? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你记得的上一件事呢？- 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the last thing you remember? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上床睡觉 然后就沦落到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to bed in my shit-hole apartment and woke up in an actual shit-hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not much to tell really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下了班要回家 其他都不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on my way home from work and I don't remember anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看过死人 亲眼看差好多\N{\fnArial\fs30}First dead body I've ever seen. Look different in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.65,0:04:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,动也不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:04:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the looks of these chains…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:05:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,某人也不希望我们走远\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone didn't want us to go very far either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.26,0:05:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有看到伤口吗？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you see any scars? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都这样 绑架下药\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what they do. They kidnap you and drug you…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.53,0:05:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你留在浴缸里盗卖你的肾\N{\fnArial\fs30}and before you know it, you're in a bathtub and your kidneys are on eBay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人取走你的肾 - 那么远你哪知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one has taken your kidneys. - How can you tell from way over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那样会痛不欲生 甚至早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you'd either be in terrible agony or you'd be dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.87,0:05:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是外科医生吗？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you, a surgeon? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你到底说不说名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you going to tell me your name or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Adam…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.49,0:05:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we need to do…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是想清楚来龙去脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}is start thinking about why we are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,下手的人大可杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever brought us here could've killed us by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.33,0:05:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定有目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must want something from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么目的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question is what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.87,0:06:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个钟 - 怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That clock. - What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.31,0:06:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它是全新的 - 所以呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's brand-new. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然有人要我们知道时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}So somebody obviously wanted us to know the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我应该够得到门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I think I might be able to reach the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.21,0:06:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.15,0:06:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是录音带 - 在哪里找到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a tape. - Where did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的口袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写 「放出来」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says "Play me."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw it over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,开不了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用衬衫捞 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Use your shirt. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.73,0:08:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的衬衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,找一下 一定有东西可用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around. There must be something else you can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.11,0:09:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么也没有 - 一定有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's nothing. - There must be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 你行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.53,0:09:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 再试一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当 起床了 你可能在想这是哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise and shine, Adam. You're probably wondering where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:10:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you where you might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是你的葬身之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might be in the room that you die in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去你都一直躲在暗处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up until now, you simply sat in the shadows…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,窥看别人的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching others live out their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.47,0:10:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷窥狂都怎么看待自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do voyeurs see when they look into the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个奇怪的综合体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I see you as a strange mix…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,愤怒却又冷漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}of someone angry and yet apathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过主要是可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mostly just pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以今天你要看着自己死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you going to watch yourself die today, Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是设法阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do something about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把录音机扔过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw me the player.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 你把带子扔过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You throw me your tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们想逃走就得合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're going to have to work together if we want to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快扔过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, just throw it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,摔坏了怎么办？你扔过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to risk breaking it. You throw me your tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登医生 我来叫醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Gordon. This is your wake-up call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.01,0:11:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每天的工作就是告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day of your working life, you have given people the news…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they are going to die soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你将成为死因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you will be the cause of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.69,0:11:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的目标是杀死亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your aim in this game is to kill Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,时限是6点之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have until 6:00 on the clock to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现场还有第三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a man in the room with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当血液中含有巨毒 唯有自尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}When there is that much poison in your blood, the only thing left to do…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}is shoot yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利的途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are ways to win this…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就藏在周遭\N{\fnArial\fs30}hidden all around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 X标示了藏宝处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just remember: "X" marks the spot for the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你没及时杀死亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do not kill Adam by 6:00…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.55,0:11:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽森和黛安娜就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}then Alison and Diana will die, Dr. Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我则会让你在这里腐烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll leave you in this room to rot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,让游戏开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽森和黛安娜就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then Alison and Diana will die, Dr. Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我则会让你在这里腐烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will leave you in this room to rot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.05,0:12:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道是谁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea who that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让游戏开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他认识我们 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He knows us. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.25,0:12:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是恶作剧对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,让游戏开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.89,0:12:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵从你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does "follow your heart" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 你旁边的马桶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, right next to you, on the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有东西吗？- 没有硬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything? - No solids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.37,0:13:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把水箱打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off the lid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知道先找这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really wish I had checked in there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.14,0:14:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一把给我好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind passing me the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,干！妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.90,0:15:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是要我们锯断铁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't want us to cut through our chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要我们锯断脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us to cut through our feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.47,0:16:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能知道是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I may know who's done this to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.01,0:16:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 我并不认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you say? - It's not someone I know personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是知道他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just someone I know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就快说 是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ! Tell me. Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.75,0:16:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last I heard…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方还没捉到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}the police still hadn't caught him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.79,0:16:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之所以知道 是因为我是嫌犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only reason I know that is because I was a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从头说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll start from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一个死很久了 至少3周\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's not fresh anymore. At least three weeks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,死者是46岁男性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victim's a 46-year-old male.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.37,0:16:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,死于大出血 主要是大腿动脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Died of massive blood loss. Mostly through the femoral artery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:16:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他硬钻过有刺的铁丝网\N{\fnArial\fs30}He started at the back of the cage…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然还钻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tunneled his way through that razor wire so fast…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's amazing he got as far as he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.89,0:17:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤口深到胃酸流了满地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut himself so deep, we found traces of stomach acid on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还找到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We also found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.67,0:17:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是身心健全的中产阶级\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a perfectly healthy, sane, middle-class male.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.27,0:17:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个月却用刮胡刀割腕自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet, last month, you ran a straight razor across your wrists.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.31,0:17:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你割腕是真的想寻死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hurt yourself because you truly wanted to die…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是只想引人注意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or did you just want some attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我拭目以待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, you'll show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.95,0:17:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,讽刺的是如果你想死 只须留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The irony is that if you want to die you just have to stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,想活 就得再次伤害自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you want to live, you'll have to cut yourself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.82,0:17:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,设法钻过铁丝网到门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}One path through the razor wire to the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过要快 3点门会上锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But hurry. At 3:00 that door will lock…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:17:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时这里就成了你的墓室\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then this room becomes your tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:18:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会为了活命流多少血？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much blood will you shed to stay alive, Paul?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,门上有计时器 3点前都开着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door was on a timer. It was unlocked until 3:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.97,0:18:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就关上了 限时2小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it snapped shut. He was given two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.18,0:18:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼图的形状\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jigsaw piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有得忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm gonna be here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.46,0:18:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,报纸开始称他为「拼图杀人狂」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The newspapers started calling him the "Jigsaw killer."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 严格来说他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, technically speaking, he is…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}not really a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有杀过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never killed anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.11,0:18:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都让死者杀死自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He finds ways for his victims to kill themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.83,0:18:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克 要是你真的病重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mark, if you're so sick…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:18:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何我拍到你经常外出\N{\fnArial\fs30}then why do I have so many photos of you up and about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们来检验你的病情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's put your so-called illness to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被注射了慢性毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, there is a slow-acting poison in your veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,解毒剂在保险箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The antidote is inside the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}The combination to the safe…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就写在墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}is written on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快输入密码 走路小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up and program it in. But watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.45,0:19:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 你身上淋了易燃物\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, that's flammable substance smeared on your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,换作是我就会小心火烛\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I would be careful with that candle, if I were you…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则被你伤害的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or all the people you've burned with your act…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会大呼痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}just might have their revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.07,0:19:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个发现 其实是两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found something else. Well, two things actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.14,0:19:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人透过这个洞往里看\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was someone standing outside here watching through this peephole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.68,0:19:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来拼图杀人狂 喜欢近距离观赏他的变态游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like our friend Jigsaw likes to book himself front row seats to his sick games.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:19:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次他也在现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there at the last one as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次他遗留了手电筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only this time, he left us his penlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 立刻采集指纹 - 知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get a rush on the prints. - Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.93,0:20:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 病患有无法开刀的前叶肿瘤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. This patient has an inoperable frontal lobe tumor…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始是结肠癌\N{\fnArial\fs30}extending across the midline. Started as a colon cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.43,0:20:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,病患到院接受检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}The patient has come in for a standard checkup…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.17,0:20:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,观察结果病情逐渐恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}by which we are able to monitor the rate at which his condition is declining.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 病患有 - 他叫约翰·戈登医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The patient had… - His name is John, Dr. Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a very interesting person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.01,0:20:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的提醒 赛普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for that information, Zep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.25,0:20:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,本院护理员和病患非常有感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, our orderlies form very special bonds with the patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们继续 病患 - 戈登医生 请联络传呼员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Continuing on, the patient… - Dr. Gordon, please page the operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人不要我说下去 失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, someone doesn't want me to tell you what the patient has. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.63,0:21:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登医生 泰普警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Gordon, I'm Det. Tapp…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.53,0:21:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛警探 重案组\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is Det. Sing. City Homicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好傲人的学历\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.17,0:21:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.61,0:21:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉打扰你工作 - 不要紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry to interrupt you while you're working. - That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.01,0:21:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us where you were…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,11点到1点在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}between the hours of 11:00 p. m. And 1:00 a. m. Last night, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.65,0:21:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要问？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it that you're interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.75,0:21:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想请教几件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to ask you a few questions about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,回局里问话对你比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your sake, I think it's best if we do it down at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.93,0:21:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你走一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to follow us there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.89,0:21:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm afraid that's quite out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能扔下工作 我太太又开了车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just leave, I have work to do. Plus, my wife has the car today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我们可以载你 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. You can ride with us, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.11,0:21:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 请再说一次 究竟是什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, you'll have to tell me again. What is this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.01,0:22:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this yours, Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.76,0:22:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道手电筒怎么会在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have no idea how your penlight showed up at the murder scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.89,0:22:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.86,0:22:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚到底在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to ask. What were you doing last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.43,0:22:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,和某人见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was seeing someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.70,0:22:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.77,0:22:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要是你不告诉我 - 一个不是病患的人 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, if you can't be honest with me… - I was visiting someone. It wasn't a patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.58,0:22:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.08,0:22:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为你的律师和朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as your lawyer and your friend, my advice to you is to bite the bullet…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.92,0:22:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你乖乖提出不在场证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give them your alibi now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:23:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖久了没人会信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because no one is going to believe you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.56,0:23:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是5个月前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was five months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.10,0:23:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想陷害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to set me up for murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.07,0:23:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你的不在场证明没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We checked your alibi. It holds up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.31,0:23:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我可以走了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Can I go home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.48,0:23:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一名幸存的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have one of the victims who managed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.95,0:23:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能留下来听听她的证词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to know if you wouldn't mind sticking around and listening to her testimony?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.65,0:23:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许你会想起什么 - 我很想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe it'll trigger something. - I'd like to help really but…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.92,0:23:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.75,0:23:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只有她没死 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's the only one who made it. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.19,0:23:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚曼妲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你慢慢说\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your own time…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.43,0:23:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最先想起什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me the first thing you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.98,0:24:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我醒来 满嘴血腥味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up. All I could taste was blood…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.65,0:24:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,满嘴血腥味\N{\fnArial\fs30}and metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.11,0:24:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚曼妲 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.71,0:24:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认识我 但我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me, but I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.35,0:24:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想玩个游戏 你输的下场是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game. Here's what happens if you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.72,0:25:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个头罩钩住了你的上下颔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The device you're wearing is hooked into your upper and lower jaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.62,0:25:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,计时器一响\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the timer at the back goes off…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.12,0:25:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的嘴就会被扯开\N{\fnArial\fs30}your mouth will be permanently ripped open.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.49,0:25:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和捕兽器正好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of it like a reverse bear trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.26,0:25:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我示范给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.94,0:25:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一把钥匙能打开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only one key to open the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.67,0:25:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在旁边的尸体肚子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the stomach of your dead cellmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.21,0:25:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看了就知道我没骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around, Amanda. Know that I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.08,0:25:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.45,0:25:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是死是活 赶快决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live or die. Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.42,0:26:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我看到尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I saw the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.00,0:26:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.74,0:27:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被注射大量麻醉剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd been injected with an opiate overdose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.84,0:27:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能动也没感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't move or feel much of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.74,0:27:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说他还活着？- 当时是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean he was alive? - Was.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.62,0:27:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿掉头罩之后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened after you took it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.44,0:28:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. You are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.71,0:28:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,人活着多半不知感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people are so ungrateful to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.01,0:28:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以后不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not you. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.99,0:29:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你有毒瘾 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are, in fact, a drug addict. Isn't that right, Mandy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.16,0:29:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他才找上你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think that is why he picked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.47,0:29:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得感激吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you grateful, Mandy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.74,0:29:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 帮了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.41,0:30:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定是他？- 我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure it's him? - Yeah, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.44,0:30:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道是真是假 搞不好是你搞的鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know you're telling the truth? You can be the one that put me in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.21,0:30:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你的处境一模一样 - 错 才不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm in exactly the same situation you are in. - Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.45,0:30:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有我没有的线索 你知道对方是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got one thing I don't: Information. You know who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.79,0:30:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道对方是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you either tell me what is really going on…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.42,0:30:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我划花你 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'll cut you with this. You hear me? I'll cut…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.30,0:30:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 这是双面镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's a two-way mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.16,0:31:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得见你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.12,0:31:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真人实境秀吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what this is. Reality TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.79,0:31:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看我 我也爱莫能助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at me. I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.76,0:31:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听得见吗？我玩得超爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me in there? I'm having a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.13,0:31:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,打手枪还爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the most fun I've had without lubricant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.54,0:31:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要全都录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you're getting everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.34,0:31:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你扔它也没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not going to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.71,0:31:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要让它拍下去？- 你阻止不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just want to leave it running on us? - He won't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.41,0:31:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以铁链锯不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we can't cut through these chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.48,0:31:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以铁链锯不断 玻璃砸不破\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why you won't break that glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.55,0:31:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个角度他都先想到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every possible angle has been pre-thought out by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.68,0:31:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像很崇拜他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like you admire this prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.79,0:31:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要对付一件事得找出破绽\N{\fnArial\fs30}To overcome something, you have to understand what a perfect engine it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.52,0:31:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对抗疾病就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you fight disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.89,0:32:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,录音带叫我们找 X\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the tape told us to find an "X."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.09,0:32:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,X 一定在这里 帮我找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That "X" has to be somewhere in this room. Help me find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.30,0:32:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么冷静 你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be the calm doctor-guy when your wife and kid are out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.83,0:32:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也在他手上 可能正在受苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got them, too. He could be doing anything to them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.07,0:32:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有想到吗？- 我正在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you thinking about that? - I am thinking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.98,0:32:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想我最后对女儿说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking about the last thing I said to my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.19,0:34:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛安娜？你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana. Honey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.16,0:34:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听得见吗？- 妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you hear me? - Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.07,0:34:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乖 怎么了？- 我房里有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it, sweet pea? - There's a man in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.74,0:34:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定不是你在乱想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, are you sure he's not just hiding in your imagination?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.37,0:34:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He talked to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.94,0:34:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 我去检查 - 我要爹地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, I'll come and check your room. - I want Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.45,0:34:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会捉住那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll get the scary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.88,0:34:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, if you want. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.65,0:34:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳瑞 打扰了 你女儿又作恶梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry, sorry to bother you, but your daughter had a bad dream again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.99,0:34:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.56,0:34:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要你去检查房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants you to check her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.03,0:34:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先写完这段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got to finish this paragraph.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.50,0:35:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sweetie, I'll go check with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.60,0:35:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 我好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.37,0:35:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 根本没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, there's no one in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.61,0:35:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有坏蛋 你可以睡了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as the bad man. Now can you go to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.65,0:35:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还是好怕 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm still scared. - You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.95,0:35:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把脚伸出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your tootsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.22,0:35:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大一只脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a big tootsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.82,0:35:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.19,0:35:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只小猪上市场 这只小猪留在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This little piggy went to market This little piggy stayed home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.29,0:35:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只小猪吃烤牛 这只小猪饿肚皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This little piggy had roast beef This little piggy had none.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.73,0:35:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只小猪一路吱吱叫着回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This little piggy went 'Whee' all the way home"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.07,0:35:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.57,0:35:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得进医院 当医生就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go to work, sweetheart. You know what Daddy's job is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.51,0:35:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.21,0:35:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖 赶快睡觉觉好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see. Try and get some sleep now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.88,0:36:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会离开我们吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to leave us, are you, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.52,0:36:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.92,0:36:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？离开你和妈咪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? You mean, leave you and Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.10,0:36:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会 我绝不会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sweetheart. I would never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.33,0:36:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你哪来的念头？- 也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who gave you that idea? - No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.94,0:36:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那回事 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not true. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.77,0:36:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有多爱你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do I love you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.84,0:36:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这么爱 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Love you very much. - Very much. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.85,0:36:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 小宝贝 - 爹地晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night, sweetie. - Good night, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.55,0:36:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明天来念你最喜欢的故事 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tomorrow, I'll read your favorite story. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.62,0:36:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知有多少时间来做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how much longer I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.89,0:36:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.12,0:37:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这样故做快乐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you walk through life pretending you're happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.66,0:37:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很快乐啊 - 胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am happy. - That is complete bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.36,0:37:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发飙恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather you break down and tell me that you hated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.30,0:37:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,都还比较有感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least there'd be some passion in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.67,0:37:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要看她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.18,0:37:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她很漂亮 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's beautiful. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.55,0:37:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们还想生吗？- 我们讨论过 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You gonna have any more kids? - We've talked about it, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.99,0:37:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前一个就忙不过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with our schedules, it's difficult enough to concentrate on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.30,0:37:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你老婆呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where is the lucky wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.70,0:37:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,背后还有一张\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another picture behind the one you're looking at.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.50,0:38:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的最爱 因为是合照\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my favorite one because we're all in it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.84,0:38:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常我都要拍照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone, usually me, has to hold the camera…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.21,0:38:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以总是少了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means I'm always missing from the photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.23,0:38:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 照片 照片不在 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not here. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.89,0:38:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你说的那张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}This photo you're talking about is not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.20,0:38:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？你确定？- 确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? Are you sure? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.78,0:38:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是他拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have taken it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.45,0:38:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这样故做快乐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you walk through life pretending you're happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.21,0:38:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很快乐啊 - 胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am happy. - That is complete bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.35,0:39:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发飙恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather you break down and tell me that you hated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.02,0:39:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发飙恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least there'd be some passion in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.89,0:39:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来再说好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talk about this later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.36,0:39:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.36,0:39:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.50,0:39:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.01,0:40:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.72,0:40:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.30,0:40:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走开！不要靠近她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that! Leave her!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.58,0:41:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个变态！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little man…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.35,0:41:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.62,0:41:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登医生知道你在他家吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Dr. Gordon know you're at home with his wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.49,0:41:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.43,0:42:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在他家做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.13,0:42:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他吗？我也在等他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for the doctor? I'm waiting for the doctor, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.24,0:42:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该放你走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that she'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.73,0:42:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道手电筒怎么会在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have no idea how your penlight showed up at the murder scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.37,0:42:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在场证明 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We checked your alibi. It holds up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.04,0:43:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对 医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该放你走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that she'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.98,0:43:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.68,0:43:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女人的遭遇真骇人听闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was quite an amazing story that poor woman told.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.83,0:43:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉无法帮上更多忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I can't be of more help to your investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.40,0:43:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,上周有个牙医被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we arrested a dentist last week…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.77,0:43:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有恋童癖\N{\fnArial\fs30}who liked to play with kids a bit too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.31,0:43:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他住在两条街外\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lived two blocks from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.11,0:43:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的污水系统和这里相通\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sewer lines run under this neighborhood, too, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.27,0:44:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚曼妲 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.73,0:44:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认识我 但我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me, but I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.60,0:44:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想玩个游戏 你输的下场是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game. Here's what happens if you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.04,0:44:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,头罩背面有计时器\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a timer at the back of the device you're wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.01,0:44:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间一到\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the timer goes off…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.11,0:44:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的嘴就会被扯开\N{\fnArial\fs30}your mouth will be permanently ripped open.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.95,0:44:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们下去我会赶上来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll catch you guys down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.35,0:44:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,和捕兽器正好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of it like a reverse bear trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.46,0:44:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来示范\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.73,0:45:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去喝一杯 你要来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna go down to The Grill, go get a beer. You wanna come?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.13,0:45:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不了 谢谢 - 我都会问一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think so. Thanks, anyway. - You know I always ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.00,0:45:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one key…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.50,0:45:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢欣赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave you to have fun here then.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.87,0:45:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在旁边的尸体肚子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the stomach of your dead cellmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.71,0:45:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我没大没小\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean for this to be disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.11,0:45:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该交个女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should find yourself a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.22,0:45:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在旁边的尸体肚子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the stomach of your dead cellmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.22,0:45:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.79,0:45:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看了就知道我没骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around, Amanda. Know that I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.06,0:45:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.66,0:45:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.53,0:45:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快回来 - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get back here. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.54,0:46:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得118街吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember 118th Street?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.75,0:46:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,K2K帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}K2K.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.62,0:46:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,地盘在四条街外\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gang's territory was only about four blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.29,0:46:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.20,0:46:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,查出\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta check the records…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.60,0:46:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两周那一带的火警纪录\N{\fnArial\fs30}from all fire emergencies that occurred there in the last two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.87,0:46:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.90,0:46:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,17号星期二晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the night of Tuesday, the 17th…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.87,0:46:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,冥河街213号的背面失火\N{\fnArial\fs30}we got a fire alarm going off in the rear wing of 213, Stygian Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.64,0:46:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里原本是橱窗假人工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an old listing. Used to be a mannequin factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.31,0:46:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以申请搜索票吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think we have enough for a warrant now?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.75,0:46:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说要申请了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said anything about a warrant?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.45,0:46:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在要去？- 不好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right now? - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.63,0:47:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然好 至少有黑暗做掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we'll have the cover of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.86,0:47:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, so will anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.17,0:47:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.14,0:48:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么玩意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.06,0:49:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.24,0:49:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sing. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.48,0:49:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先观察动静 - 为什么？他完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's see what's he's gonna do. - Why? We got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.78,0:49:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想先确定 先等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what he looks like. Lets see what he's gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.72,0:49:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fucking way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.65,0:49:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛 我要制服他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck that. I'm gonna take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.75,0:49:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck? Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.76,0:50:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫 你已经醒了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awake already, Jeff?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.39,0:50:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次要用更强的药 别哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need more powerful tranquilizers next time. Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.80,0:50:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你活得有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given your life a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.33,0:50:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个很伟大的实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a test subject for something greater than yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.50,0:50:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不准动！警察 - 站住不准动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Freeze! Police. - Hold it right there! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.90,0:50:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your fucking hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.34,0:50:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you'll make a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.88,0:51:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,20秒后这个人将一命呜呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 20 seconds, the life of this man will be ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.75,0:51:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴跪下 - 快关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up and get down here. - Turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.35,0:51:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛 关机器 我来搞定他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing, stop that thing. I'm taking this bastard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.45,0:51:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.55,0:51:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么关？- 叫他关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you turn it off? - Tell him how to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.96,0:51:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得用钥匙 - 在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One key will unlock it. - Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.32,0:51:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在那个盒子里 - 盒子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's in the box. - Box?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.06,0:51:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是哪一把？- 快告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which key? - Tell him which key it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.70,0:51:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时间快没了 - 闭嘴跪下 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time is running out. - Get down here right now, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.07,0:51:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪件事比较重要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's more important to you, Officer…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.20,0:51:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕我 还是另一条人命？\N{\fnArial\fs30}arresting me, or the life of another human being?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.57,0:51:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跪下 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down on your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.61,0:51:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪！- 救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus! - Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.08,0:51:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实有病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am sick, Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.11,0:51:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰普！有好多钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tapp, it's none of the keys here!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.62,0:51:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在受病魔侵袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick from the disease eating away at me inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.52,0:51:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨身在福中不知福的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick of people who don't appreciate their blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.62,0:51:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲弄他人痛苦的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick of those who scoff at the suffering of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.63,0:52:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.27,0:52:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！泰普 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Tapp. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.41,0:52:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.54,0:53:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住 否则我开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze! Or I'll shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.78,0:54:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你 让你跪下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.15,0:54:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're running.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.42,0:54:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓跑了 因为你被逮到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're running scared because we had you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.25,0:54:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要破案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to close this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.09,0:54:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要破案 对吧 辛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've closed it. We're right, Sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.42,0:54:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要破案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to close this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.06,0:55:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,X 标示了藏宝处\N{\fnArial\fs30}"X" marks the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.60,0:55:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得再找一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should search this room again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.77,0:55:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.11,0:55:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.48,0:55:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为我们俩在一个房间里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because I'm stuck in this room with you…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.54,0:55:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不必每10秒就向你回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean I have to report to you every 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.11,0:55:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没理由不互相帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really don't see the point in us not helping one other.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.52,0:55:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样？我行动不便\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to do? I'm on a leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.42,0:55:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们才要讨论思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly why we need to talk. We need to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.05,0:55:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在思考啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.49,0:55:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别让我瞎猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then don't keep me in the dark about what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.86,0:55:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关灯 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn off the lights. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.20,0:55:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快关灯 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn them off, now, please! - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.97,0:55:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之先关个灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just turn them off for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.95,0:56:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 在你背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus! Behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.42,0:56:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 之前怎么没看到？- 因为之前灯没落下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How come we didn't see that before? - The lights in here hadn't charged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.49,0:56:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一定是要吸光的夜光漆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be glow-in-the-dark paint or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.82,0:56:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快打开 - 锁住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open it. - It's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.32,0:57:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的信封里的钥匙呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key. The one from my envelope. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.20,0:57:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the fuck… Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.32,0:57:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,手机 世上最赞的发明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cell phone. The most beautiful invention on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.83,0:57:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是第二赞的发明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make that second most beautiful invention.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.29,0:57:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我 - 你疯啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me that. - Are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.36,0:57:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要抽这房里的烟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna put something we found in this room in your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.37,0:57:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意冒险 让我得肺癌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I'm willing to risk it. Give me that sweet cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.04,0:58:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 别说话 给我一根烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care, I really don't. Give me one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.54,0:58:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证香烟没有毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cigarettes are harmless, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.01,0:58:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽烟抽出人命才有毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smoking is only poisonous when it ends in bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.98,0:58:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必用枪也能杀亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about this: You don't need a gun to kill Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.18,0:58:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦把烟给我好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I please have a cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.85,0:58:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.00,0:58:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.07,0:58:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这支手机只能接不能打\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was meant to receive calls, not make them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.14,0:58:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我之前也遇过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. This has happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.94,0:58:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚我离开医院后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night, after I finished at the hospital…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.81,0:58:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走去开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was walking back to my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.92,0:59:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为只有我 显然还有别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was alone, but I'm sure someone else was there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.39,1:00:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个怪物就等在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing. It was waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.87,1:00:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道要关灯？- 管他的 反正有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you know to turn off the lights? - Who cares? It worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.97,1:00:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你怎么知道？- 直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, but how did you know? - Instinct.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.64,1:00:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 直觉？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Instinct? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.01,1:00:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？你是个大骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You're a terrible liar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.21,1:01:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又认识我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that like you know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.65,1:01:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么没说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else aren't you telling me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.58,1:01:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.85,1:01:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我6岁生日那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my sixth birthday, my best friend at that time, Scott Tibbs…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.45,1:01:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,被死党拿生锈的钉子刺伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}stabbed me with a rusty nail. I didn't tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.89,1:01:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃素的女性主义女友甩了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't tell you my last girlfriend, a feminist vegan punk…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.82,1:01:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我太愤世嫉俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}broke up with me because she thought I was too angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.26,1:01:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有一个脚趾甲 - 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I haven't told you that one of my toenails… - Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.63,1:01:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道要关灯 - 随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You knew to turn off these lights. - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.87,1:01:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是幼稚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dealing with a juvenile.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.57,1:01:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想知道？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wanna know? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.57,1:01:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.42,1:01:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.09,1:02:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.66,1:02:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你女儿的照片后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in your wallet, behind the photo of your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.30,1:02:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么不拿给我看？- 我不忍心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't you show me this before? - I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.74,1:02:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.65,1:02:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把她们怎么了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing to them, you bastard?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.02,1:02:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我得思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I got to think now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.63,1:02:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必用枪也能杀亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about this: You don't need a gun to kill Adam.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.13,1:02:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当血液中含有巨毒 唯有\N{\fnArial\fs30}When there is that much poison in your blood, the only thing left to do…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.80,1:02:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,自尽才能解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}is shoot yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.26,1:03:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.60,1:03:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.84,1:03:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.61,1:03:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当 听我说 你跟我演出戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam, listen to me. I want you to play along with me on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.92,1:04:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.19,1:04:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你 还想抽烟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you still want that cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.73,1:04:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.76,1:05:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我下手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, I've done it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.49,1:05:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我照暗示毒死他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've killed him with the poison, just like you wanted!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.02,1:05:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人呢？在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where is my family? Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.94,1:05:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.97,1:05:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我被电了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just got electrocuted. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.18,1:06:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是大好机会 - 你没听见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was our way out. - Did you hear what I said?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.71,1:06:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我把它拿掉 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this thing off me. Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.48,1:06:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别演戏了 - 难不成我会故意拆穿你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop acting. - You think I would make that up…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.68,1:06:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你出的出意 他妈叫我演戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to mess up your stupid, fucking charade?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.05,1:06:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.20,1:06:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.94,1:06:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember everything now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.01,1:06:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起事情经过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember how I got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.38,1:09:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.86,1:09:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.56,1:09:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.60,1:10:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.34,1:10:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？谁在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that? Who's in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.48,1:10:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来 小心我宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out! I'll kill you, you motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.78,1:11:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁？- 爹地？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is this? - Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.09,1:11:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黛安娜？- 爹地 是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Diana? - Daddy, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.96,1:11:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby, it's me. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.23,1:11:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,爹地我好怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.86,1:11:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕 不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, honey. Everything's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.73,1:11:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈咪呢？- 她在旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is Mommy? - She's here with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.30,1:11:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我跟她说 叫妈咪听电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me talk to her, sweetie. Okay? Put Mommy on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.47,1:11:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个坏人在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad man from my room is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.67,1:11:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绑住我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has us tied up…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.51,1:11:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he has a gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.74,1:11:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么坏人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What man?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.91,1:11:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please come home, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.31,1:11:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.55,1:11:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛安娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.86,1:12:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 劳瑞 - 艾丽？是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Larry? - Ali?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.96,1:12:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当在那里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Adam there?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.97,1:12:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.84,1:12:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽 这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ali, what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.51,1:12:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要相信亚当的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't believe Adam's lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.67,1:12:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认识你 他早就认识你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows you. He knew all about you before today.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.01,1:12:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？艾丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Ali?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.22,1:12:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.29,1:12:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.06,1:12:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢碰她们 我就宰了你 听到没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you so much as lay a finger on them, I'll kill you! Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.86,1:12:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋！我宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch. I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.40,1:12:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.00,1:13:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太太提到你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife, she mentioned your name.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.14,1:13:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.35,1:13:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.38,1:13:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.18,1:13:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me about what?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.39,1:13:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说你认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me you know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.46,1:13:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.06,1:13:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.53,1:13:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说慌了！你这个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the lies. You're a liar!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.56,1:13:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要听实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know the truth!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.57,1:13:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是骗子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a liar?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.84,1:13:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do last night, Lawrence?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.61,1:13:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在医院救治病童吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work at a hospital? Saving sick children?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.57,1:13:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你昨晚出门后去了医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me that after you left your house last night, you went to work at a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.08,1:13:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.91,1:13:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 你老婆说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not. Your wife is right, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.05,1:14:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在停车场不是被拍照？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't recall getting your picture taken in that parking lot?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.43,1:14:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以证明你昨晚没去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can prove that you didn't go anywhere near a hospital last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.58,1:14:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不是第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the first time I've done it either, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.14,1:14:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟拍你几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been taking pictures of you for a few days now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.82,1:14:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.98,1:14:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我专门拿钱跟拍你这种有钱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna know what I do? I get paid to take pictures of rich guys like you…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.75,1:14:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,上九流宾馆跟秘书乱搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}who go to seedy, out-of-the-way motels to fuck their secretaries.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.16,1:14:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚我去你家看着你出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night I went to your house. I watched you leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.43,1:14:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed you…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.30,1:15:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直跟到那个破宾馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the way to that shitbag hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.90,1:15:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直带在身上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had these with you the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.54,1:15:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们跟锯子摆在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found them in there, with the hacksaws.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.97,1:15:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也莫名其妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how they got there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.51,1:15:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也莫名其妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. You're so full of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.81,1:15:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧 我们都一样 但我的相机不会说慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face it, Larry, we're both bullshitters, but my camera isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.55,1:15:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只会呈现事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't know how to lie. It shows you what's put right in front of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.68,1:15:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进去做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just out of curiosity, what did you do in that motel room?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.25,1:15:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么快就出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got out of there pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.33,1:15:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我在家还call我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you deem it necessary to page me when you knew I was at home?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.47,1:15:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕你不能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know if you were gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.00,1:15:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指定了联络时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I gave you a precise time at which to page me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.44,1:15:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.41,1:16:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂这种事的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like I know the rules for this sort of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.95,1:16:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登医生 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, Dr.Gordon?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.48,1:16:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不该找你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it was wrong of me to make you come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.62,1:16:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为我们 - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I thought we… - Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.42,1:16:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.80,1:16:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有告诉别人吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You tell anyone you were here? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.85,1:16:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.98,1:16:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找你的 - 我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's for you. - For me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.73,1:17:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.81,1:17:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的丑事 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're doing, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.02,1:17:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得走了 - 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to go. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.66,1:17:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.18,1:17:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁？- 谁是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who was it? - Who was what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.78,1:17:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁雇用你跟拍我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The person who paid you to follow me? Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.28,1:18:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自称鲍伯 钱也付了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He calls himself Bob and he gives me the money up front.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.08,1:18:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一晚200\N{\fnArial\fs30}$200 a night.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.65,1:18:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知如此就开天价\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I knew I was gonna end up here, I would've asked for more.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.65,1:18:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？你看到我被捉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean you saw what happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.79,1:18:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只看到你上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I saw was you get into your car. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.46,1:18:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没问你的名字 我不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask your name. I didn't know who you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.09,1:18:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我们是怎么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how I got here, I don't know how you got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.56,1:18:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是拍照 回家洗照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just took the shots and went straight home to develop.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.50,1:18:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就被链在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next thing I know, I'm chained to a pipe…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.07,1:18:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个破厕所里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in some pre-historic bathroom…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.14,1:18:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我跟拍的人对看\N{\fnArial\fs30}staring at the guy I've been taking shots of all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.70,1:18:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你雇主捉我们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, whoever paid you to take pictures of me is the one who put us here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.44,1:18:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许吧 - 你说“或许”是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe. - What do you mean maybe?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.84,1:18:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就是 他的长相呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it is. What did he look like?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.61,1:18:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是个男人 - 是高是瘦是胖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He was just a guy. - Was he tall, skinny, obese, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.21,1:18:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没注意长相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't take notes about his appearance.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.05,1:18:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一定有印象 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must remember something of him. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.11,1:18:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember a thing about the guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.02,1:18:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说过 - 算了！我放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you… - For fuck's sake! I give up!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.85,1:18:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个高大的黑人 脖子有疤\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a tall, black guy. He's got a scar around his neck, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.66,1:19:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tapp!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.73,1:19:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰普警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Det. Tapp.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.73,1:19:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,雇用我的人可不是条子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy who paid me to take these photos was not a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.04,1:19:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他被解职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He was discharged from the police force.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.47,1:19:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭档死后他崩溃了 但他还是来骚扰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He broke down after his partner was killed. But that didn't stop him from harassing me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.84,1:19:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走火入魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy became obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.84,1:19:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相信我有涉案 他疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He convinced himself I must have somehow been involved with the murders…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.65,1:19:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你帮了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you helped him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.88,1:19:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你收钱侵犯我的隐私\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took money from him to invade my privacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.05,1:19:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么能这样 - 这叫讨生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How could you do that? - Call it my need to eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.16,1:19:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.06,1:19:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？你不是受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You're not a victim of this game…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.99,1:19:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是帮凶 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you're a part of it. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.79,1:19:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个条子觉得你是主谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously this cop thinks you're the one behind it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.56,1:19:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过他不是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, he's not a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.50,1:19:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是个人渣 跟你一样 - 你是比较气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a bottom feeder. Just like you. - What are you more pissed off about?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.27,1:19:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偷拍你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I took some shots of you…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.97,1:19:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是气我拍到你背叛老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}or that I took shots while you were cheating on your wife?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.87,1:19:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有背叛她 - 你管我怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did not cheat on her! - Why do you care what I think anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.21,1:20:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我管你玩性爱游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a crap if you covered yourself in peanut butter…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.21,1:20:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞15P\N{\fnArial\fs30}and had a 15 hooker gang-bang.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.42,1:20:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.92,1:20:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情本来好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had everything in order.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.23,1:20:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My whole life was in perfect order.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.98,1:20:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.32,1:21:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在一定要很勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy just needs you to be really strong right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.39,1:21:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你受到伤害 懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to let anybody hurt you. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.36,1:21:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一言为定\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.15,1:21:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚你家里还有别人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, was there someone else at your house last night…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.95,1:21:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 除了你的妻女以外 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- besides your wife and daughter? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.39,1:21:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拍到一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's someone here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.50,1:22:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识他 是赛普\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know him. Zep!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.21,1:22:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫赛普\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Zep.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.21,1:22:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是院里的护理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an orderly in my hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.35,1:22:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛普 你这个变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}You perverted little psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.41,1:22:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要看你遭天谴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take great pleasure in seeing you pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.12,1:22:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,混帐王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bastard! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.66,1:22:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.26,1:22:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.78,1:23:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乖 - 妈咪救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - Mommy, help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.86,1:23:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登医生的时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Gordon's time is up.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.57,1:23:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该动手了 而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I gotta do what I've gotta do, and…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.80,1:23:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕得由你来宣告他失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid it has to be you that tells him he failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.31,1:23:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛普是你吗？我知道是你 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you, Zep, you bastard! I know it's you, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.42,1:23:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 劳瑞？- 艾丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Larry. - Ali?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.89,1:23:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.32,1:23:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.90,1:24:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 不准起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move! Stay on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.70,1:24:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.24,1:24:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.88,1:24:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 劳瑞 - 艾丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Larry? - Ali!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.42,1:24:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey, are you all right? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.52,1:24:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不 坐下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not… Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.15,1:24:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.15,1:24:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我被囚禁在一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I'm being held captive in a room somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.82,1:24:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.09,1:24:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾丽 对不起 - 我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so sorry, Ali. - Larry, we need you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.63,1:24:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都是我不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for everything. It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.06,1:24:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我 你带给我幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please forgive me. I've always been happy with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.87,1:24:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.04,1:24:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ali!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.39,1:25:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.07,1:25:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.18,1:25:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.19,1:25:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.51,1:26:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登太太？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Gordon?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.54,1:26:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.62,1:26:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去杀了你老公\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill your husband now, Mrs. Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.91,1:27:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.01,1:27:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 快起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence, get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.99,1:27:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence, get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.53,1:27:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.07,1:27:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 我以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God! I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.74,1:28:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他用电电我 - 我就说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He electrocuted me. - I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.85,1:28:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才也是 我没骗你吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same thing happened to me, see? I wasn't lying, see?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.32,1:28:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck this shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.37,1:29:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋！我宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you, you sick asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.17,1:29:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.97,1:29:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 你冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.68,1:29:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会有办法的 - 你闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There must be a way out of here. - I can't be calm!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.31,1:29:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family needs me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.71,1:29:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.67,1:29:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.61,1:30:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 你冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence, please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.81,1:30:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a way out of here. There's a way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.05,1:30:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.29,1:30:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.99,1:31:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 你想干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.38,1:31:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.85,1:32:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.75,1:32:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence, don't! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.19,1:32:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊 我求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence, please! I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.56,1:32:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 不是我害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence, it's not me who did this to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.56,1:32:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你非死不可 - 不！我想活\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to die. - No, I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.70,1:32:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 我想活\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.80,1:32:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.05,1:32:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我动手了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done it!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.25,1:32:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我见她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now show them to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.82,1:32:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much, Officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.12,1:32:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 劳瑞？- 打通了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Larry? - Did you get through to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.62,1:32:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是没人接\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still no answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.12,1:32:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧 我报警了 放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I've called the police. Everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.84,1:33:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋！我宰了你 我宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bastard! I'll fucking kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.48,1:33:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋 我宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking bastard! I'll fucking kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.09,1:33:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.66,1:33:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 这是游戏规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - It's the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.46,1:34:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事的 我只伤了你的肩膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to be all right. You're just wounded in the shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.60,1:34:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去求援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go and get help.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.82,1:34:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要离开我 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.82,1:34:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我会带人回来 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I'll bring someone back. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.23,1:35:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Key.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.34,1:35:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Key!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.43,1:36:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因铎先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mr. Hindle…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.53,1:36:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在医院里人称 赛普\N{\fnArial\fs30}or as they called you around the hospital: Zep.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.37,1:36:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你做个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to make a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.54,1:36:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的体内有慢性毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a slow-acting poison coursing through your system…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.01,1:36:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才有解毒剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}that only I have the antidote for.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.11,1:36:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会杀害一对母女以自救吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you murder a mother and her child to save yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.98,1:36:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登医生的时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr.Gordon's time is up.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.22,1:36:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Gordon?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.15,1:36:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果会的话 规则如下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen carefully, if you will. There are rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.89,1:36:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 这是游戏规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - It's the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.53,1:37:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁链的钥匙在浴缸里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Key to that chain is in the bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.00,1:37:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人很有意思 他叫约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a very interesting person. His name's John.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.04,1:37:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有无法开刀的前叶肿瘤\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has an inoperable frontal lobe tumor…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.47,1:37:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在受病魔侵袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick from the disease eating away at me inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.11,1:37:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来拼图杀人狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like our friend Jigsaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.34,1:37:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨身在福中不知福的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick of people who don't appreciate their blessings.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.95,1:37:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢近距离观赏他的变态游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like our guy likes to book himself front row seats to his sick games.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.55,1:37:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.25,1:38:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登医生 我想玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Gordon, I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.41,1:38:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,人活着多半不知感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people are so ungrateful to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.78,1:38:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以后不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not you. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.28,1:38:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game over.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.56,1:38:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走！别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
